## Syntax  
A custom analyzer has the following syntax:  
```json
"analyzers": [
{
"name": "<name>",
"charFilters": [ <list-of-character-filters> ],
"tokenizer": {
"type": "<tokenizer-type>"
},
"tokenFilters": [ <list-of-token-filters> ]
}
]
```

