The `listSearchIndexes` command returns a cursor. As a result, it doesn't immediately return the indexes matched by the command. To access the results, use a cursor paradigm such as the `toArray()` method. To learn more, see [Access Data From a Cursor.](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/node/current/fundamentals/crud/read-operations/cursor/)  
