#### Compound Example  
The following query searches for the term `organic` in the `category` field and `variety` in the `description` field. The `highlight` option in the [`$search`](/docs/search/query/aggregation-stages/search#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-search)  [compound](/docs/search/query/operators-collectors/compound#std-label-compound-ref) query requests highlighting information only for the [text](/docs/search/query/operators-collectors/text#std-label-text-ref) query against the `description` field. Note that the `highlight` option inside the [`$search`](/docs/search/query/aggregation-stages/search#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-search) stage must be a child of the [`$search`](/docs/search/query/aggregation-stages/search#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-search) stage, and not of any operator inside the [`$search`](/docs/search/query/aggregation-stages/search#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-search) stage.  
