### Search Across Multiple Fields  
The following query searches the `title` and `plot` fields of the `movies` collection for words that begin with the character string `inter` using the [compound](/docs/search/query/operators-collectors/compound#std-label-compound-ref) operator.  
Copy and paste the following query into the Query Editor, and then click the Search button in the Query Editor.  
```javascript
[
{
$search: {
compound: {
should: [
{
autocomplete: {
query: "inter",
path: "title"
}
},
{
autocomplete: {
query: "inter",
path: "plot"
}
}
],
minimumShouldMatch: 1
}
}
}
]
