### Query and Sort  
The following query searches for items named `laptop` and it sorts the results by the `items.tags` field. The query includes a [`$limit`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/limit/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-limit) stage to limit the output to `5` documents and a [`$project`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/project/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-project) stage to:  
