### Disjoint Example  
The following example uses the `geoShape` operator to search for properties that have nothing in common with the specified longitude and latitude coordinates in Hawaii.  
The query includes a:  
- [`$limit`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/limit/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-limit) stage to limit the output to `3` results.  
- [`$project`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/project/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-project) stage to exclude all fields except `name` and `address`.  
