### Synonyms Example  
The following queries search the `plot` field in the `movies` collection for the terms in the given query string. MongoDB Search returns results based on the [type of mapping](/docs/search/index/synonyms#std-label-synonyms-ref) in the [synonym source collection](/docs/search/index/synonyms#std-label-synonyms-coll-spec), `synonymous_terms`, specified in the synonym mapping definition of the index for the `sample_mflix.movies` collection.  
The following query searches for the phrase `automobile race` anywhere in the `plot` field with a distance of up to `5` between the terms.  
```json
db.movies.aggregate([
{
$search: {
"phrase": {
"path": "plot",
"query": "automobile race",
"slop": 5,
"synonyms": "my_synonyms"
}
}
},
{
"$limit": 5
},
{
$project: {
"_id": 0,
"plot": 1,
"title": 1,
score: { $meta: "searchScore" }
}
}
])
```  
