### Index Definition  
The following index definition indexes the `title` field in the `movies` collection with the [keyword analyzer:](/docs/search/index/analyzers/keyword#std-label-ref-keyword-analyzer)  
```javascript
{
"mappings": {
"fields": {
"title": {
"analyzer": "lucene.keyword",
"type": "string"
},
"genres": {
"type": "token"
}
}
}
}
```

