### Use Facet with the Paginated Results  
#### Use searchSequenceToken with MongoDB Search facets.  
To group results by using MongoDB Search [`facet` (MongoDB Search Operator)](/docs/search/query/operators-collectors/facet#std-label-fts-facet-ref), you must index any `string` field as the `token` type. To run the following query and group the results by the `genres` field in the `movies` collection, your index must resemble the following example:  
```json
{
"mappings": {
"dynamic": true,
"fields": {
"genres": {
"type": "token"
}
}
}
}
}
```  
The sample query uses the following pipeline stages:  
| Pipeline Stage | Description |
| --- | --- |
| [`$search`](/docs/search/query/aggregation-stages/search#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-search) | Searches for titles that contain `summer` in the `title` field by using the [`facet` (MongoDB Search Operator)](/docs/search/query/operators-collectors/facet#std-label-fts-facet-ref) collector.; Retrieves a count of the number of total movies in the results in each genre by using `facets` option. |
| [`$addFields`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/addFields/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-addFields) | Adds the `paginationToken` field to store the tokens for each document in the results generated by using the [searchSequenceToken](/docs/search/query/paginate-results#std-label-paginate-results-search-sequence-token) option. |
| [`$limit`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/limit/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-limit) | Limits the results to `10` documents. |
| [`$facet`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/facet/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-facet) | Returns the following fields: `docs` field, which contains only the `title`, `released`, and `genres` fields from the documents in the results and the `paginationToken` field.; `meta` field, which contains a count of the total number of movies in the results in each genre that is stored in the `$$SEARCH_META` variable. |  
```json
db.movies.aggregate([
{
"$search": {
"index": "pagination-tutorial",
"facet": {
"operator": {
"text": {
"path": "title",
"query": "summer"
}
},
"facets": {
"genresFacet": {
"type": "string",
"path": "genres"
}
}
}
}
},
{
"$addFields": {
"paginationToken" : { "$meta" : "searchSequenceToken" }
}
},
{ "$limit": 10 },
{
"$facet": {
"docs": [
{ "$project":
{
"_id": 0,
"title": 1,
"released": 1,
"genres": 1,
"paginationToken" : 1
}
}
],
"meta": [
{ "$replaceWith": "$$SEARCH_META" },
{ "$limit": 1 }
]
}
},
{
"$set": {
"meta": {
"$arrayElemAt": ["$meta", 0]
}
}
}
])
```  
