### Constant  
This query uses the following pipeline stages:  
- [`$search`](/docs/search/query/aggregation-stages/search#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-search) to query the collection. The query:  
- Uses the following `compound` operator clauses:  
- `filter` clause with the [range](/docs/search/query/operators-collectors/range#std-label-range-ref) operator to search for movies between the years `2013` to `2015`.  
- `should` clause with the [text](/docs/search/query/operators-collectors/text#std-label-text-ref) operator to query for the term `snow` in the `title` field and alter the `score` with the `constant` option. The `constant` option replaces all score results for the search term with `5`.  
- Specifies the [highlight](/docs/search/query/highlighting#std-label-highlight-ref) option to return snippets of text from the `title` field that match the query. The snippets contain matching text specified with `type: 'hit'`, and adjacent text specified with `type: 'text'`.  
- [`$limit`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/limit/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-limit) stage to limit the output to `10` results.  
- [`$project`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/project/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-project) stage to:  
- Exclude all fields except `title` and `year`  
- Add a `score` field  
```json
db.movies.aggregate([
{
"$search": {
"index": "default",
"compound": {
"filter": [{
"range": {
"path": "year",
"gte": 2013,
"lte": 2015
}
}],
"should": [{
"text": {
"query": "snow",
"path": "title",
"score": {"constant": {"value": 5}}
}
}]
},
"highlight": {
"path": "title"
}
}
},
{
"$limit": 10
},
{
"$project": {
"_id": 0,
"title": 1,
"year": 1,
"score": { "$meta": "searchScore" },
"highlights": { "$meta": "searchHighlights" }
}
}
])
```  
