},
{ _id: 1, c: true, score: 0.029335692524909973 }
]

```  
#### Descending Sort (Default)  
During a descending sort, MongoDB Search returns documents with null or missing values at the bottom of the results by default, as shown in the following example:  
```json
db.users.aggregate([
{
"$search": {
"text": {
"path": "b",
