The query uses the [`$limit`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/limit/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-limit) stage to limit the output to `5` documents. It also uses the [`$project`](https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/operator/aggregation/project/#mongodb-pipeline-pipe.-project) stage to perform the following actions:  
